        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Better not to open it…&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s more terrifying - the daily grind against the backdrop of a creative crisis, or real monsters straight from Hell?<br>Live through the ordinary days of a writer tormented by the absence of inspiration. Take a shower, snack in front of the TV, try to write something... And soon, this routine will turn into pure horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/aa345076736506caf81e0a2c7ae54e79.poster.avif?t=1760978133\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/aa345076736506caf81e0a2c7ae54e79.webm?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/aa345076736506caf81e0a2c7ae54e79.mp4?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Clark — a young and acclaimed writer whose debut novel became an international bestseller. Fame, money, recognition — he had it all. But now, a year has passed, and Clark hasn’t written a single word. A relentless creative block consumes him from the inside. Alone in his luxurious mansion, he struggles to put even a sentence on paper… and fails every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One sleepless night, the doorbell rings. On the porch, Clark finds a mysterious package with no sender. From that moment on, his life begins to spiral into a nightmare far darker than any writer’s block.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s inside the box? And more importantly… what happens once you open it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/4b29b0845931e5e28202a5a2c4475c3f.poster.avif?t=1760978133\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/4b29b0845931e5e28202a5a2c4475c3f.webm?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/4b29b0845931e5e28202a5a2c4475c3f.mp4?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“You’ve Got a Package”</strong> is a short horror game in the walking simulator and exploration genre. You are about to live through the most nightmarish night of your life. Unspeakable horrors and terrors will crawl out from the darkness, eager to feast on your sticky fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By unleashing an ancient demon, you’ll be dragged straight into a living Hell — and nothing will help you escape alive or unharmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/7c6571f826469489f9af5cb21bde9f4f.poster.avif?t=1760978133\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/7c6571f826469489f9af5cb21bde9f4f.webm?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/7c6571f826469489f9af5cb21bde9f4f.mp4?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, concise gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy, unsettling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design that drags you into chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vivid and striking visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flashlights — everything unfolds in the light</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast variety of horrors guaranteed to give you chills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/2be060afdd60ee02a5c61d17b859a263.poster.avif?t=1760978133\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/2be060afdd60ee02a5c61d17b859a263.webm?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game duration: 1 hour – 1 hour 20 minutes</p>",
