aragraph\" >Dynamic storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy, unsettling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design that drags you into chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vivid and striking visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flashlights — everything unfolds in the light</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast variety of horrors guaranteed to give you chills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/2be060afdd60ee02a5c61d17b859a263.poster.avif?t=1760978133\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/2be060afdd60ee02a5c61d17b859a263.webm?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game duration: 1 hour – 1 hour 20 minutes</p>",
